# =============================================================================
# Vercel deployment (free tier) — set these in the Vercel dashboard, not here.
# =============================================================================

# --- App auth (required) ---
# Generate strong values, e.g. `openssl rand -base64 48`.
ADMIN_PASSWORD=
ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET=

# --- Storage mode (required for the admin panel to persist on Vercel) ---
# Vercel's filesystem is read-only, so the default file/local mode cannot save.
PACKAGE_STORE=kv
IMAGE_STORE=blob

# --- Vercel KV (auto-injected when you link a KV store to the project) ---
# KV_REST_API_URL=
# KV_REST_API_TOKEN=
# Optional: override the single key that holds the whole catalog.
# PACKAGE_CATALOG_KV_KEY=packages:catalog

# --- Vercel Blob (auto-injected when you link a Blob store to the project) ---
# BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=
# Optional: object path prefix for uploaded images.
# BLOB_PACKAGE_IMAGE_PREFIX=packages

# --- Public site identity (used for metadata, footer, JSON-LD, sitemap) ---
# Real contact details ship as defaults in lib/site-config.ts; these vars only
# override them per environment (e.g. a staging number).
#
# Canonical production URL, no trailing slash. REQUIRED in production for
# correct Open Graph, canonical and sitemap URLs.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://noahsway.example
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_PHONE=+63 917 192 1136
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL=sales.noahsway@gmail.com
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FACEBOOK_HANDLE=noahswaytravel
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FACEBOOK_URL=https://www.facebook.com/noahswaytravel/
# NEXT_PUBLIC_INSTAGRAM_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ADDRESS_STREET=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ADDRESS_CITY=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ADDRESS_REGION=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ADDRESS_POSTAL=

# --- Business registrations (shown in the footer and policy page) ---
# Philippine buyers are advised to verify these before paying a travel agency.
#
# DTI and BIR already carry Noah's Way's real numbers as defaults in
# lib/site-config.ts, so they publish whether or not you set anything here —
# these two vars only override them. DOT and PTAA are blank and render a
# visible "To be added" placeholder until filled in, so an unfinished entry is
# obvious rather than silently missing.
#
# Deploying this site for a DIFFERENT business? Set both of the first two to
# that business's own numbers, or clear the defaults in site-config. Leaving
# them unset publishes Noah's Way's registrations under the new name.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DTI_REGISTRATION=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BIR_REGISTRATION=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DOT_ACCREDITATION=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PTAA_MEMBERSHIP=

# --- Lead notification (optional but strongly recommended) ---
# Fire-and-forget POST on each new inquiry so leads don't sit unread in the
# admin inbox. Works with Zapier / Make / Slack / Discord webhook URLs.
# INQUIRY_NOTIFY_WEBHOOK_URL=

# --- Confirmation email (strongly recommended) ---
# Without these the form still promises "we reply within 24 hours" but the
# customer receives nothing. Both must be set for the channel to activate.
# The from-address must be on a domain verified in your Resend account.
# RESEND_API_KEY=
# INQUIRY_EMAIL_FROM="Noah's Way Travel <bookings@yourdomain.com>"
# Where the internal alert goes. Defaults to NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL.
# INQUIRY_EMAIL_TO=

# --- Facebook Page posting (Admin -> Facebook) ---
# Lets "Post to Facebook" in Admin -> Packages publish a package as a photo post
# on the Page. Nothing posts automatically: sharing is a button press, and it is
# refused until an admin switches it on in Admin -> Facebook.
#
# Both values are normally entered in that panel instead, where the token is
# encrypted with ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET. Set them here only to bootstrap a
# deployment before anyone opens the panel, or to keep the token out of the
# datastore entirely. A value saved in the panel wins over the variable.
#
# The token must be a PAGE access token (not a personal user token) carrying
# pages_manage_posts and pages_read_engagement. Get one from
# developers.facebook.com -> Graph API Explorer, then exchange it for a
# long-lived token. It is revoked if the issuing admin loses Page access or
# changes their password, so expect to re-enter it occasionally.
# FACEBOOK_PAGE_ID=
# FACEBOOK_PAGE_ACCESS_TOKEN=
# Optional: pin a different Graph API version (default v21.0).
# FACEBOOK_GRAPH_VERSION=v21.0
# Optional: override the KV key holding the Facebook panel's settings.
# FACEBOOK_SETTINGS_KV_KEY=facebook:settings
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL above must be the live address: it is what every post
# links to, so a localhost value makes the share refuse rather than publish a
# link nobody can open.

# --- Poster reader (Admin -> Packages -> "Read poster") ---
# Transcribes an uploaded package poster into the form fields for review.
# Works with either provider, using whichever is configured for the assistant
# below or in Admin -> AI Assistant.
#
# Defaults: claude-sonnet-5 (Anthropic) / gpt-4.1 (OpenAI). Sonnet was measured
# against Opus on these posters and matched it field for field at ~60% less, so
# a costlier model is not the lever here — run-to-run variance is larger than
# the gap between models, which is why a thin read is retried once.
#
# Set this to override the model for whichever provider is active.
# AI_POSTER_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5

# --- AI booking assistant (optional) ---
# The assistant is OFF until an admin switches it on in Admin -> AI Assistant.
# There is no environment variable for that: setting a key here is not the same
# as consenting to spend it, so nothing below can put the chat in front of
# customers on its own. Until it is enabled, the launcher is hidden and the site
# is unchanged.
#
# Everything else here is a fallback. Admin -> AI Assistant is also where the
# provider, API key, and model are set, and any value saved there wins over the
# variable below. Keys saved in the panel are encrypted with
# ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET, so rotating that secret means re-entering them.
#
# Set them here only to bootstrap a deployment before anyone opens the panel,
# or to keep keys out of the datastore entirely.
#
# AI_PROVIDER picks the adapter; leave it unset to use whichever key is present.
# AI_PROVIDER=anthropic
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# Override the provider's default model (claude-sonnet-5 / gpt-4.1).
# claude-opus-5 costs ~60% more for no measured gain on this workload.
# AI_MODEL=
# How long a chat transcript and its staged booking draft survive, in seconds.
# CHAT_SESSION_TTL_SECONDS=86400
# Optional: override the KV key holding the admin assistant settings.
# AI_SETTINGS_KV_KEY=ai:settings
